{"2650780":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Cavern","steam_appid":2650780,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment, Explore, and Swap in Cavern, a roguelike sandbox.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a rag tag group of cavers on a mission to data log and film Mirror Cavern for a new Television Special!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(funded by yours truly... the Geo Cave Survey.) <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2650780\/extras\/5649dfa3fe256e70f64967242f9cc592.webp?t=1790270034\" width=32 height=32 \/><\/span><strong>Cavern - a Roguelike Sandbox<\/strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2650780\/extras\/5649dfa3fe256e70f64967242f9cc592.webp?t=1790270034\" width=32 height=32 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every situation presents a unique challenge and a unique solution whether you decide to fight or meddle. Each character has the ability to swap out objects in the game at will, and gains more swaps along the way to pair with their playstyle. As you go deeper into the Cavern, the level generation becomes more chaotic, and you will gain more control...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the game by putting objects where they were never intended to be!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2650780\/extras\/a4e502c3c10d68a98d499f527816846e.poster.avif?t=1790270034\" width=198 height=202 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2650780\/extras\/a4e502c3c10d68a98d499f527816846e.webm?